  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.9 - WebGPU correctness: ML now chooses its warp-shuffle kernels (vector decode attention, register attention, the Q4_K shuffle GEMV, TRELLIS.2 shuffle attention) with SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.22's SupportsWarpShuffle instead of WarpSize == 32, which a browser without the subgroups feature also reports while its warp is the whole workgroup - 5.8.8 could compute wrong attention there. CUDA: the Q4_K decode GEMV reduces with warp shuffles (+1-1.5% decode). On SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.22. Release sweep 7,654 passed, 0 failed. Full notes: CHANGELOG.md.",
